@guide A_Shadowmoon
@name Shadowmoon Valley (Wildhammer Stronghold)
@faction Alliance
@levels 68-70
@zone Shadowmoon Valley
@chapter Outland
@desc Wildhammer Stronghold: the Legion Hold chain, the Deathforge, the Netherwing ledge approach and the Hand of Gul'dan. Ends at 70.

